TEXT 1584 0 Left 2 ;---- DRV8873S (DRV8873SPWPR), SIGN-MAGNITUDE PWM (one leg held, other leg switching), 100 kHz, Z AXIS ----
TEXT 1584 32 Left 2 ;Current A->B (D >= 0.5): M4 held on, leg A switches at duty |2D-1|.  Current B->A (D < 0.5): M2 held on, leg B switches.  Off-time freewheels through both low sides.
TEXT 1584 64 Left 2 ;EN = PWM pin (duty |2D-1|), PH = direction pin: the two signals the STM32 sends in the DRV8873's PH/EN mode (EN = 0 drives both outputs low = brake).
TEXT 1584 112 Left 2 ;---- ADJUST THESE ----
TEXT 1584 144 Left 2 !.param Vbus=24 fsw=100k
TEXT 1584 176 Left 2 !.param Lc=21.0m Rc=4.42
TEXT 1584 208 Left 2 !.param I0=-3.12 I1=3.12 Islew=1e6
TEXT 1584 240 Left 2 !.param t1=100m tstop=200m
TEXT 1584 272 Left 2 !.param Lf=1p RLf=0 Cf=1p ESR=0
TEXT 1584 304 Left 2 !.param kT=1.5 Tamb=30 SR=53.2e6
TEXT 1584 352 Left 2 ;---- DRV8873 values (datasheet: 150 mOhm HS+LS at 25 C, 250 mOhm at 150 C, RthJA 27.8 C/W, fastest slew 53.2 V/us, tPD ~1.5 us) ----
TEXT 1584 384 Left 2 !.param Rds=75m Npar=1 td=200n Vg=10 RthJA=27.8 Pq=0.12 tmin=2u
TEXT 1584 416 Left 2 !.param Ron={Rds*kT/Npar} Rpath={2*Ron} Rtot={Rc+Rpath+2*RLf}
TEXT 1584 448 Left 2 !.param T={1/fsw} dd={td/T} Dmin={0.5-(1-tmin*fsw)/2} Dmax={0.5+(1-tmin*fsw)/2}
TEXT 1584 480 Left 2 !.param D0={0.5*(1+I0*Rtot/Vbus)} D1={0.5*(1+I1*Rtot/Vbus)} tramp={abs(I1-I0)/Islew}
TEXT 1584 512 Left 2 !.param Rgs={(Vg-4)/(0.8n*SR)}
TEXT 1584 544 Left 2 !.model NFET VDMOS(Vto=3 Kp=40 Rd={Ron-2m-1/(40*(Vg-3))} Rs=2m Rg={Rgs} Cgdmax=0.8n Cgdmin=0.05n Cgs=1.5n Cjo=0.6n Is=1e-11 Rb=20m)
TEXT 1584 576 Left 2 !.tran 0 {tstop} 0 {T/100}
TEXT 1584 608 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Iavg AVG I(Rcoil) FROM {tstop-2m} TO {tstop}
TEXT 1584 640 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Iripple PP I(Rcoil) FROM {tstop-2m} TO {tstop}
TEXT 1584 672 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Pdrv AVG (V(VBUS)-V(A))*Id(M1)+V(A)*Id(M2)+(V(VBUS)-V(B))*Id(M3)+V(B)*Id(M4) FROM {tstop-2m} TO {tstop}
TEXT 1584 704 Left 2 !.meas Tj PARAM {Tamb+RthJA*(Pdrv+Pq)}
TEXT 1584 736 Left 2 ;kT = FET resistance vs temperature (1 = 25 C, 1.5 = ~120 C, 1.67 = 150 C).  Rgs slows the gate so output edges approximate the slew rate SR; check V(A) or V(B) edges and adjust.
TEXT 1584 768 Left 2 ;tmin = shortest usable pulse (tPD + edges); Dmin/Dmax keep the duty below 80% of the period.  td = dead time assumed for the model (the chip sets its own).
TEXT 1584 800 Left 2 ;At 100 kHz this run is long (fine timestep): for a quick check use t1=20m tstop=40m.  Results: View > SPICE Error Log.
